/-- **The Nieuwland number of `Antiprism.SquareAntiprism.polyhedron`, by representatives**: `ν Antiprism.SquareAntiprism.polyhedron` lies in `[k, k + 1] / 10 ^ 30`, and it is the first coordinate of the root of each of finitely many systems of integer polynomial equations, each in a rational box of all its variables and each with exactly one root in its box (`IsPolyRootEq`, `Modules/System/PolyRootEq.lean`); the systems are those of `prismSquareAntiprism_nu_reps_list`. -/
theorem prismSquareAntiprism_nu_reps :
    ν Antiprism.SquareAntiprism.polyhedron ∈ Set.Icc ((1028535456300117981667660866605 : ℝ) / 10 ^ 30) ((1028535456300117981667660866606 : ℝ) / 10 ^ 30) ∧
      IsPolyRootEq (ν Antiprism.SquareAntiprism.polyhedron) :=
